      "text": "12-day private tour of Suriname: rainforest and culture"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "04a82228db9ef61694d8d0cbfb9cecb880937550a776ee9fc8ae8bb34ad8599b",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9trov9-0oxzxedywb",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Over 12 days, you’ll see different sides of Suriname, from Paramaribo’s colonial architecture to mangroves, rivers and Amazon rainforest. Spend several days at Kabalebo Nature Resort, far from the city and surrounded by jungle and wildlife. Then continue to Upper Suriname, where you’ll learn about Maroon culture and daily life in the riverside villages."
